The layer shell plugin in layershell is written for Chalk. The way a Qt shell integration plugin
works, with the private API of QtWaylandClient, follows the plugin of LayerShellQt, a KDE project
under LGPL-2.1-or-later and MIT, which was read as a reference. No code was copied.
